#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/wifi_espc201/07-iot_Auto_watering_system.rst:19
msgid "7. Auto Watering System with Blynk"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/wifi_espc201/07-iot_Auto_watering_system.rst:28
msgid "A soil moisture probe goes into the pot and a small pump sits in a glass of water. The board reports how wet the soil is, and - once you allow it - switches the pump on by itself before the plant gets thirsty."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/wifi_espc201/07-iot_Auto_watering_system.rst:32
msgid "From the phone you can watch the moisture, drag a slider to choose how dry the soil may get, and decide whether the kit is allowed to water on its own."
msgstr ""

